    <requireLicenseAcceptance>false</requireLicenseAcceptance>
    <summary>Offline Word DOCX viewer with printing and Markdown export.</summary>
    <description><![CDATA[Nebula DOCX is an offline Windows desktop viewer for Microsoft Word .docx documents. Microsoft Word is not required.

Features:
- Open DOCX files with a native file picker, drag and drop, or Windows Open with.
- Preview pages, headings, tables, images, headers and footers.
- Search, navigate document headings and pages, zoom and fit to width.
- Print using the Windows print dialog, including Microsoft Print to PDF.
- Export Markdown with embedded images, or Markdown plus image files in a ZIP.
- No accounts, uploads, telemetry or network access in the installed app.

Requires Windows 10 or 11 x64. Legacy .doc and encrypted documents are unsupported. Preview layout may differ from Microsoft Word, especially for complex layouts, fonts and automatic pagination. This package installs for all users. The initial installer is unsigned.

Nebula DOCX is not affiliated with or endorsed by Microsoft.]]></description>
    <releaseNotes>https://github.com/Porkstone/nebula-docx/releases/tag/v1.0.0</releaseNotes>
    <tags>nebula-docx docx word viewer markdown converter print offline</tags>
  </metadata>
  <files><file src="tools\**" target="tools" /></files>
</package>
